                  <li><a href="/commercial/billing" class="block p-1.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-[#003366]">Billing</a></li>
                  <li><a href="/commercial/tariff-petitions" class="block p-1.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-[#003366]">Tariff Petitions</a></li>
